<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lim Family lowers Seafresh stake.</title>
<headline>Lim Family lowers Seafresh stake.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seafresh NZ Ltd said on Wednesday that Lim Family Holdings had lowered its stake in the company to 74.76 percent from 82.22 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
